WEBVTT

00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:06.000
Wake up, Bohman.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.030
Along with your new memories.

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:12.000
Playmaker is coming.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:30.660
Playmaker!  I was waiting for this moment!

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:43.230
We've traveled really far!

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:46.220
We'll capture them today!

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:50.320
They made me suffer by 
feeding me a strange virus.

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:53.740
It's payback time!

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:55.800
Only if they're really here.

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:57.420
They are!

00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:04.780
Wow!  Pretty!

00:01:11.220 --> 00:01:14.740
But nothing’s here.

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:17.740
Did Windy trick us?

00:01:17.740 --> 00:01:20.230
Windy said there was a chance.

00:01:20.230 --> 00:01:21.960
He didn’t promise.

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:24.440
That’s true, but…

00:01:24.440 --> 00:01:27.110
Damn, it was a waste of time.

00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:30.450
Is something there?

00:01:30.910 --> 00:01:31.910
Let’s go!

00:01:31.910 --> 00:01:32.910
Right!

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:58.350
Our lives aren't forever

00:01:59.150 --> 00:02:05.160
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:02:06.090 --> 00:02:12.440
Even if it's not the right direction, 
just keep looking forward

00:02:12.930 --> 00:02:19.010
Sharing hope for the future

00:02:19.010 --> 00:02:25.780
tell me  We're searching for 
memories lost in the darkness

00:02:25.970 --> 00:02:33.020
I feel your flame  Your 
impulses pierce the light

00:02:33.150 --> 00:02:39.700
I want to share your pain

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:13.180
No one’s here.

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:18.610
What?

00:03:25.320 --> 00:03:28.020
What’s going on?

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:32.640
Playmaker!

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:33.600
What?

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:40.740
Another one!

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:58.830
I've been waiting for you, Playmaker!

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:00.140
Bohman!

00:04:00.140 --> 00:04:01.560
He showed up!

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:06.060
But he seems different than before.

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:08.840
Did he change his image?

00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:13.440
Bohman, give back Kusanagi’s 
brother’s consciousness data!

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:15.180
Fine.

00:04:16.010 --> 00:04:17.910
But if I win…

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:20.040
You get to have me, right?

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:23.650
I have no interest in you.

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:26.440
What?  You don’t want me?

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:29.500
What I need is…

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:33.020
You’ll find out when our match ends.

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:39.260
I can’t believe my boom is already over.

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:51.630
That’s…

00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:53.630
A Master Duel field.

00:04:53.630 --> 00:04:56.040
Follow me, Playmaker!

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:57.150
Let’s duel!

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:05.850
He was fleeing last time, but he 
really wants to duel this time.

00:05:05.850 --> 00:05:07.690
How suspicious.

00:05:07.690 --> 00:05:09.820
He must have a plan.

00:05:09.820 --> 00:05:13.620
But I expected that from the start!

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:15.600
I’ll end it here!

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:22.280
I accept this match!

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:28.550
Today, I'll stain your disrespectful 
face in the color of despair!

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:31.880
Brother!

00:05:31.880 --> 00:05:34.890
Haru, you stay there.

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:36.350
Yes, brother!

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:42.830
Well then, I’ll observe 
the power given to Bohman.

00:05:42.830 --> 00:05:43.930
Here I go!

00:05:43.930 --> 00:05:44.780
Bring it!

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:45.830
Duel!

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:49.530
I go first.

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:56.500
I Special Summon Hydradrive Booster 
from my hand in attack position!

00:05:56.500 --> 00:06:01.330
I can Special Summon it from my 
hand when neither of us have

00:06:01.330 --> 00:06:03.610
monsters in our Main Monster Zones.

00:06:04.100 --> 00:06:08.290
Appear!  The circuit that connects the truth!

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:13.360
The summoning condition is one Hydradrive!

00:06:15.950 --> 00:06:17.420
Link Summon!

00:06:17.420 --> 00:06:20.770
Link 1 Burn Hydradrive!

00:06:21.050 --> 00:06:27.500
When you have a Fire monster on your 
field, this card can attack you directly.

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:29.770
There it is, Playmaker!

00:06:29.770 --> 00:06:31.600
A fire one this time!

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:32.510
Yeah.

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:38.190
If it matches our Attribute, his 
monster can attack us directly.

00:06:39.090 --> 00:06:41.180
It’s the same deck as before?

00:06:41.180 --> 00:06:42.740
Of course.

00:06:42.740 --> 00:06:46.500
When he chose to go first, I 
thought he's use a different deck.

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:48.080
Why?

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:49.650
Oh, I see!

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:51.600
You can’t attack if you go first.

00:06:51.600 --> 00:06:56.670
So it's better to go second and see what 
we do so that he can match our Attribute.

00:06:57.120 --> 00:07:00.860
But he knows that already.

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:03.640
That means he has a plan.

00:07:04.530 --> 00:07:07.370
What's he planning?

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:10.380
Try to figure out my strategy!

00:07:10.380 --> 00:07:14.050
Next, I summon Hydradrive Booster!

00:07:16.320 --> 00:07:20.430
Appear again!  The circuit 
that connects the truth!

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:25.570
I set Hydradrive Booster in the Link Marker!

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:27.930
Link Summon!

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:31.200
Link 1 Coolant Hydradrive!

00:07:32.270 --> 00:07:37.540
This field becomes a place to 
judge and expose your crimes!

00:07:38.380 --> 00:07:40.140
My crimes?

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:45.000
From my hand, I activate the 
Link Spell, Judgment Arrows!

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:47.380
There's his Link Spell!

00:07:47.380 --> 00:07:53.250
When the Link Monster linked to this 
card battles, its ATK are doubled!

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:55.960
So he did play that card.

00:07:55.960 --> 00:08:00.510
His monsters' ATK are essentially 2000!

00:08:00.510 --> 00:08:03.140
Here comes the main event!

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:07.170
Appear!  The circuit that connects the truth!

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:11.920
The summoning conditions are 
two Hydradrive Link Monsters!

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:17.250
I set Burn and Coolant Hydradrive 
in the Link Markers!

00:08:18.820 --> 00:08:20.580
Link Summon!

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:24.780
Appear, Link 2 Twin Hydradrive Knight!

00:08:28.170 --> 00:08:30.150
A Link 2 monster!

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:33.200
Whoa!  I've never seen that before!

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:37.420
When Twin Hydradrive Knight 
is Link Summoned...

00:08:37.420 --> 00:08:40.520
...its Attributes can become 
the same as its Link Materials.

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:44.270
Let the two powers reside in your sword!

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:48.620
Twin Hydradrive Knight becomes 
Fire and Water Attribute!

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:53.480
Fire and Water.  A monster 
with two Attributes.

00:08:53.480 --> 00:08:56.220
I set two cards.

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:59.450
Playmaker, I'll let you know this:

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:04.720
These two set cards will decide 
the outcome of this duel!

00:09:05.530 --> 00:09:09.290
But you can’t defeat me!

00:09:09.290 --> 00:09:13.720
Because I know your thoughts 
like they’re my own!

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:17.250
I end my turn.

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:19.070
Bring it, Playmaker!

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:25.440
His dueling was sloppy last time, 
but he's prepared this time.

00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:27.290
Hey, Playmaker.

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:31.550
His set cards may be trouble.

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:33.310
No doubt.

00:09:33.310 --> 00:09:36.920
One is definitely Property Spray.

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:41.280
He can use it to change the 
Attribute of our monster.

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:44.760
So he already set that card.

00:09:44.760 --> 00:09:49.150
Even if it’s not, he’s 
making us wary of it.

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:51.840
Did he really plan all that?

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:54.320
That’s totally different than before!

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:56.840
But that’s not all.

00:09:56.840 --> 00:10:00.430
Something's clearly different than before.

00:10:00.430 --> 00:10:03.070
Something hidden inside him…

00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:06.840
I'll uncover it in this duel!

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:09.070
My turn!  I draw!

00:10:09.390 --> 00:10:12.700
From my hand, I summon Flame Bufferlo!

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:17.760
And from my hand, Catche Eve L2’s effect!

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:25.240
I can Special Summon her from my hand by 
lowering my Level 3 or higher monster's Level by 2.

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:31.400
I lower Flame Bufferlo to Level 1 
to Special Summon Catche Eve L2!

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:37.040
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:41.520
The summoning condition 
is one Level 1 monster.

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:42.940
Link Summon!

00:10:42.940 --> 00:10:45.680
Link 1 Linkuriboh!

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:48.270
Get fired up, Linkuriboh!

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:52.970
Flame Bufferlo’s effect activates!

00:10:52.970 --> 00:10:59.530
When it leaves the field, I discard a 
Cyberse monster from my hand to draw two cards.

00:11:01.280 --> 00:11:05.870
Next, I Special Summon Cyberse 
White Hat from my hand!

00:11:05.880 --> 00:11:11.950
I can Special Summon White Hat when there 
are at least two monsters with the same Type.

00:11:11.950 --> 00:11:15.390
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:11:15.950 --> 00:11:20.840
The summoning conditions are two 
Level 2 and higher Cyberses!

00:11:21.130 --> 00:11:22.570
Link Summon!

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:26.400
Appear, Link 2 Update Jammer!

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:32.140
A Wind Attribute monster…

00:11:32.780 --> 00:11:35.120
He avoided Fire and Water.

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:38.360
White Hat’s effect activates 
from the graveyard!

00:11:38.360 --> 00:11:41.710
When it's used to Link Summon 
and sent to the graveyard...

00:11:41.710 --> 00:11:47.680
...all monsters on your field lose 
1000 ATK until the end of the turn!

00:11:49.690 --> 00:11:54.540
Battle!  Update Jammer attacks 
Twin Hydradrive Knight!

00:11:54.540 --> 00:11:58.160
The Link Spell, Judgment Arrows’s effect!

00:11:58.160 --> 00:12:01.370
It doubles the ATK of the 
monster next to its link!

00:12:02.970 --> 00:12:05.550
That’s pointless!

00:12:05.550 --> 00:12:07.610
Go get 'em, Playmaker!

00:12:07.610 --> 00:12:08.860
Not yet.

00:12:09.260 --> 00:12:10.220
For real?

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:13.230
Update Jammer’s effect activates!

00:12:13.230 --> 00:12:18.780
When a Cyberse battles, all 
other effects are negated...

00:12:18.780 --> 00:12:22.330
...and the battle uses 
the original ATK and DEF!

00:12:22.330 --> 00:12:26.040
So the Link Spell’s effect is negated!

00:12:26.760 --> 00:12:29.920
But its ATK went up.

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:33.370
Go, Update Jammer!

00:12:42.410 --> 00:12:48.570
Due to Update Jammer’s effect, when it 
destroys your monster in battle, you take 1000 damage!

00:12:53.050 --> 00:12:56.880
I see!  This way, the damage is higher!

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:59.530
Next, Linkuriboh attacks you directly!

00:13:07.860 --> 00:13:11.060
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:17.980
You used Update Jammer to stop 
Judgment Arrows’s effect.

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:21.860
But you can’t stop my next attack.

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:23.980
My turn.  I draw!

00:13:25.660 --> 00:13:28.460
This card can attack you directly!

00:13:28.460 --> 00:13:32.200
I activate the Continuous 
Trap, Property Spray!

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:37.820
By tributing my monster, I 
regain LP equal to its ATK.

00:13:37.820 --> 00:13:40.420
Then your monster’s 
Attribute becomes the same

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:44.170
as the tributed monster’s 
until the end of the turn.

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:48.200
I knew it!  A card that changes Attribute!

00:13:48.200 --> 00:13:50.720
But I expected that!

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:54.690
I activate the Counter Trap, Arrow Break!

00:13:54.690 --> 00:14:00.800
When there’s a Link Monster on my field, I can 
negate a trap card’s activation and destroy it!

00:14:00.800 --> 00:14:03.530
I destroy Property Spray!

00:14:05.890 --> 00:14:08.460
He knew he'd play Property Spray!

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:10.930
I knew you'd do that.

00:14:11.860 --> 00:14:16.940
You knew?  You anticipated our Counter Trap?

00:14:17.240 --> 00:14:21.180
You're also concerned 
about my other set card.

00:14:21.180 --> 00:14:27.920
But when Property Spray activated, you had 
no choice but to activate your Counter Trap.

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:32.430
But I told you this card 
would decide the outcome.

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:36.620
I activate the Continuous 
Trap, Hydradrive Cycle!

00:14:36.920 --> 00:14:42.270
I can activate it when my spell 
or trap card is destroyed.

00:14:43.380 --> 00:14:47.340
Wow!  He anticipated 
Playmaker’s anticipation!

00:14:47.340 --> 00:14:51.450
Regret your own foolishness, Playmaker!

00:14:59.860 --> 00:15:03.820
I’ll show you Hydradrive Cycle’s power.

00:15:04.720 --> 00:15:06.560
What's he gonna do?

00:15:06.560 --> 00:15:10.770
I return a Hydradrive Link Monster 
in my graveyard to my deck...

00:15:10.770 --> 00:15:13.800
...to draw cards up to its 
number of Link Markers.

00:15:14.490 --> 00:15:18.740
I return Twin Hydradrive 
Knight to draw two cards.

00:15:18.740 --> 00:15:24.730
Then I Special Summon a Hydradrive from 
my graveyard by lowering its ATK to 0.

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:27.820
Resurrect, Burn Hydradrive!

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:33.260
Hydradrive Cycle’s additional effect!

00:15:33.260 --> 00:15:37.900
I pay 400 LP to Special 
Summon a Hydradrive Token...

00:15:37.900 --> 00:15:44.360
...with either Fire, Wind, 
Water or Earth Attribute!

00:15:44.360 --> 00:15:48.900
I Special Summon an Earth Hydradrive Token!

00:15:52.060 --> 00:15:54.000
He drew and Special Summoned!

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:57.410
And he even chose the Attribute.

00:15:57.410 --> 00:15:58.920
That's not fair.

00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:05.380
Property Spray and Hydradrive Cycle 
were both set on the first turn.

00:16:05.380 --> 00:16:09.070
So he expected this from the start?

00:16:10.170 --> 00:16:12.720
I was in the palm of his hand!

00:16:12.720 --> 00:16:17.200
You're incapable of anticipating my plans.

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:19.500
Here I go, Playmaker!

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:22.880
You can't escape me anymore!

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:26.450
Appear!  The circuit that connects the truth!

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:32.420
I set Hydradrive Token in the Link Marker!

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:34.370
Link Summon!

00:16:34.370 --> 00:16:37.980
Link 1 Flow Hydradrive!

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:42.960
Appear again!  The circuit 
that connects the truth!

00:16:42.960 --> 00:16:49.060
I set Burn Hydradrive and Flow 
Hydradrive in the Link Markers!

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:51.520
Link Summon!

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:56.060
Appear again, Link 2 Twin Hydradrive Knight!

00:16:59.480 --> 00:17:06.360
Twin Hydradrive Knight, let Fire 
and Wind reside in your sword!

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:11.420
Twin Hydradrive Knight’s effect!

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:13.370
When it's on the field...

00:17:13.370 --> 00:17:18.860
...your monsters with the same Attribute 
as this card has their effects negated!

00:17:18.860 --> 00:17:22.900
Update Jammer is Wind, so 
its effects are negated!

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:27.740
I like the look on your face, Playmaker.

00:17:27.740 --> 00:17:31.460
But it's not a true face of despair yet!

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:33.740
I'll pressure you more!

00:17:33.740 --> 00:17:39.160
Battle!  Twin Hydradrive 
Knight attacks Update Jammer!

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:40.780
This is bad!

00:17:40.780 --> 00:17:44.480
He’ll use his Link Spell to double its ATK!

00:17:44.480 --> 00:17:46.680
Linkuriboh’s effect activates!

00:17:46.680 --> 00:17:51.150
I tribute Linkuriboh to lower 
your monster’s ATK to 0!

00:17:53.400 --> 00:17:58.360
That's pointless.  I discard Break 
Hydradrive to activate its effect!

00:17:58.360 --> 00:18:03.130
It negates Linkuriboh’s effect 
and deals you 800 damage!

00:18:03.130 --> 00:18:04.110
What?

00:18:09.050 --> 00:18:12.520
Nice!  He stopped Playmaker’s 
strategy again!

00:18:13.160 --> 00:18:16.270
Linkuriboh, I’ll never forget you!

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:21.470
The Link Spell, Judgment Arrows’s effect!

00:18:21.470 --> 00:18:27.870
When the Link Monster linked to this 
card battles, its ATK are doubled!

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:33.550
3600 ATK?

00:18:33.550 --> 00:18:35.680
This is bad, Playmaker!

00:18:35.680 --> 00:18:37.290
Can't you do anything?

00:18:38.540 --> 00:18:41.630
Be gone, Playmaker!

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:53.850
Are you okay, Playmaker?

00:18:54.220 --> 00:18:56.860
What’s with him?

00:18:56.860 --> 00:18:59.580
How can he be stronger this quickly?

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:03.530
I set one card and end my turn.

00:19:05.980 --> 00:19:09.260
You look pathetic, which fits you.

00:19:09.260 --> 00:19:14.060
Continue the duel and fight to the end!

00:19:14.060 --> 00:19:16.040
You know-nothing fake!

00:19:16.040 --> 00:19:17.800
Fake?

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:20.000
What’s he talking about?

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:23.720
I know your thoughts as if they're mine.

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:26.750
There’s no way you can defeat me.

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:31.480
Because I'm you, and you're me!

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:34.270
What do you mean?

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:37.450
Bohman, who are you?

00:19:38.620 --> 00:19:42.430
I’m a victim of the Lost 
Incident ten years ago.

00:19:42.640 --> 00:19:43.680
What?

00:19:44.510 --> 00:19:48.890
He was in a separate room during 
the incident, like Spectre?

00:19:50.190 --> 00:19:53.000
I’m talking about the Dark Ignis.

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:55.540
A truth even you don’t know.

00:19:56.520 --> 00:20:00.890
Playmaker, you said you're a 
victim of the Lost Incident.

00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:05.610
But is that actually true?

00:20:05.610 --> 00:20:07.130
What do you mean?

00:20:07.340 --> 00:20:12.860
I told you.  I’m you, and you’re me.

00:20:13.800 --> 00:20:18.590
Ten years ago, you said you 
were kidnapped and locked up.

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:23.820
And by observing you, that Ignis was created.

00:20:24.480 --> 00:20:34.570
Your data, feelings, thoughts, experience, 
everything during that time was backed up.

00:20:39.640 --> 00:20:47.000
That backup was another 
you created digitally.

00:20:47.820 --> 00:20:50.910
What do you mean?

00:20:50.910 --> 00:20:54.970
But due to an accident, that backup…

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:17.070
No way…  It's not true!

00:21:17.070 --> 00:21:19.500
Changed places with the real one.

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:20.940
What?

00:21:20.940 --> 00:21:23.500
No way!  Seriously?

00:21:23.500 --> 00:21:26.050
In other words, I’m the real one.

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:30.110
And you’re the fake backup, Playmaker!

00:21:30.110 --> 00:21:31.960
That can't be true!

00:21:33.280 --> 00:21:39.440
That’s why I know your 
thoughts and how you duel!

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:44.680
Me - sealed away in the digital 
world - was waiting for this chance!

00:21:44.680 --> 00:21:49.920
The day I'd defeat the 
fake and regain my body!

00:21:55.230 --> 00:22:01.400
I'll defeat you in this 
duel!  And become you!

00:22:20.030 --> 00:22:26.370
Memories that don't disappear
And memories that disappeared

00:22:26.600 --> 00:22:33.070
I quietly "NOW LOADING..." those scenes

00:22:33.500 --> 00:22:36.570
Memories left behind  Erased memories

00:22:36.570 --> 00:22:39.710
What was the PASSWORD again?

00:22:40.140 --> 00:22:44.310
ACCESS records  Restored memories

00:22:44.580 --> 00:22:47.280
Challenge "the you inside you"

00:22:51.990 --> 00:22:58.160
You're a Network  The 
World that spreads beyond

00:22:58.300 --> 00:23:01.300
With repeating "nows"

00:23:01.630 --> 00:23:05.240
What about you?  "Live for now"

00:23:05.400 --> 00:23:11.190
Grab the Shooting Star in 
the sky with both your hands

00:23:11.340 --> 00:23:14.480
Overcome "now" with all your might  Yell!

00:23:36.510 --> 00:23:38.700
Who's that over there?

00:23:38.700 --> 00:23:43.340
This feeble question echoed pointlessly.

00:23:43.340 --> 00:23:49.360
His body was taken, leaving an 
isolation that can't be healed.

00:23:49.360 --> 00:23:54.320
To free his long-held hatred, 
Bohman's anger explodes.

00:23:54.320 --> 00:23:59.040
I'll say one thing: Whoever 
wins this duel is right.

00:23:59.040 --> 00:24:02.750
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
Soul Replica

00:24:02.750 --> 00:24:05.050
Into the VRAINS!
